     A                                  1 65'Time:'
     A            HDTIME         8A  O  1 71
     A                                  2 32'Program TARIBAM00'
     A**===============================================================
     A**=== maint screen
     A**===============================================================
     A          R S01
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                  5  5'**Note - Subsystem CSISMMIS must b-
     A                                      e active to Start Monitor Job'
     A                                  8 29'1) Start Monitor Job (TaribaMon)'
     A                                  9 29'2) End Monitor Job (TaribaMon)'
     A                                 11 29'3) Maintain Process and Job Files'
     A                                 12 29'4) Maintain DataQ Parameters'
     A                                 15 11'Enter an Option:'
     A            S1OPTION       1   B 15 29
     A  10                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  10                                  COLOR(RED)
     A**=== HOLD CURSOR FLD (NON DISPLAY)
     A            S1HOLDCR       1   B 15 31DSPATR(ND)
     A**===============================================================
     A**=== MESSAGE LINE
     A**===============================================================
     A          R B01
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'F3-Exit            '
